he first time you spawned there. While frustrating at first, the process soon becomes part of the challenge to get better.\n\nI look forward to multi-player in this game. I am sure extra help will be necessary in longer hauls.\n\nThank you for reading.", "timestamp_created": 1562534847, "timestamp_updated": 1562534847, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "53946975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057463801", "personaname": "Bodnar4342", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bodnar4342/", "num_games_owned": 1569, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 4280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 101, "last_played": 1741143538, "avatar": "8084197be5d6e511b111d124ec625b761b11cb84"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is absolutely amazing. risk of rain 1 but 3d with some extra content added in as well. i love the rogue-like genre and i only found the two of these recently through youtube but after playing for a few hours im addicted", "timestamp_created": 1562534175, "timestamp_updated": 1562534175, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "53946067", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993259974", "personaname": "theevilgamerwhokillspeople", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/browan626/", "num_games_owned": 596, "num_reviews": 100, "playtime_forever": 18135, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 4343, "playtime_at_review": 1296, "last_played": 178926941